      "prompt": "在下列净离子方程式所描述的反应中，Br<sub>2</sub> 的生成速率为 6.0 × 10<sup>−6</sup> mol/L/s：${\\text{5Br}}^{\\text{−}}+{\\text{BrO}}_{3}{}^{\\text{−}}+{\\text{6H}}^{\\text{+}}\\;\\longrightarrow \\;{\\text{3Br}}_{2}+{\\text{3H}}_{2}\\text{O}$<br>写出联系各反应物的消耗速率与各产物的生成速率的方程式。",
      "answer": {
        "type": "open",
        "generated_by": "source",
        "solution": "$-\\;\\frac{1}{5}\\;\\frac{\\text{Δ}[{\\text{Br}}^{\\text{−}}]}{\\text{Δ}t}\\;=-\\;\\frac{\\text{Δ}[{\\text{BrO}}_{3}{}^{\\text{−}}]}{\\text{Δ}t}\\;=-\\;\\frac{1}{6}\\;\\frac{\\text{Δ}[{\\text{H}}^{\\text{+}}]}{\\text{Δ}t}\\;=\\;\\frac{1}{3}\\;\\frac{\\text{Δ}[{\\text{Br}}_{2}]}{\\text{Δ}t}\\;=\\;\\frac{1}{3}\\;\\frac{\\text{Δ}[{\\text{H}}_{\\text{2}}\\text{O}]}{\\text{Δ}t}$"
      }
    },
